OPIPP - Open PIPP
=================

This repository contains an independent, clean reimplementation of the command-line and processing
behaviour of PIPP (Planetary Imaging PreProcessor), originally written by Chris Garry.

- OPIPP is NOT affiliated with, endorsed by, sponsored by or supported by Chris Garry or the PIPP
  project, and it is not an official PIPP release.
- The MIT licence in LICENSE covers the original work in this repository only. It does not grant any
  rights in PIPP itself, and it does not relicense anything by the original author.
- No original PIPP binaries are distributed here. The decompiled output and Ghidra listings used as
  development reference are not included in this repository or its history.
- The project reproduces file formats and a command-line vocabulary for interoperability and
  modernization, and is published in the belief that this is fair use. That is the project's
  position, not a legal determination.

If you are the rights holder and want something changed or removed, please open an issue and it will
be handled promptly.
